@page "/stream"
@attribute [StreamRendering]

<PageTitle>Stream rendering (streamed)</PageTitle>

<section class="stream-demo">
    <h1>With <code>[StreamRendering]</code></h1>
    <p>
        The server flushes chunks as each section's <code>await</code> resolves.
        You should see the three placeholders appear immediately,
        then each section fill in one second at a time.
    </p>

    <a class="toggle-link" href="/stream-blocking">
        → see the same component <strong>without</strong> [StreamRendering]
    </a>

    <StreamSections />
</section>

<RenderModeBadge />
